"float" id="F1"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>Chromosome PPLs. A, chromosome 1; B, chromosome 2;C, chromosome 3; D, chromosome 4; E, chromosome 5; F, chromosome 11;G, chromosome 14; H, chromosome 17</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2156-4-S1-S75-1"/></fig></sec></back></article>